# ThermoHammer

> ThermoHammer is a free benchmark and thermal stress test for Android, iPhone and Windows. It scores a whole device in six sections (CPU, memory, GPU, everyday UX, AI, on-device LLM) against a fixed reference, and runs a sustained-load stress test that shows when a device throttles and how much of its speed it keeps. This site publishes the public leaderboard: verified runs only, scored on the server.

Scale: 6,000 points per section is a Snapdragon 8 Elite phone as it ships; the total is the six sections added up (36,000 for the reference). Stability is the share of full speed a device delivers over a 5, 15 or 30 minute full-load run.

